    "Name": "Hellbringer VI",
    "Details": "A 65-ton design that emphasizes overwhelming firepower over speed or armor, the Hellbringer is a Clan OmniMech. Powered by a 325-rated XL Engine, the Hellbringer has 28.5 tons of pod space. A customised variant supposedly belonging to Star Commander Joanna of Clan Jade Falcon, the Hellbringer VI is armed with a pair of ER Large Lasers, an LRM-20 and an LRM-15. 4 ER Medium Lasers cover close range combat.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Integrated Searchlight</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.12</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
